        <item>
            <title>0.4.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 04:07:57 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>202611210407</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.4.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>27.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Fixed</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Heat protection acts sooner.</b> It pauses charging once the battery has been above the threshold for one minute, not three. macOS still takes a minute or two to stop charging after that.</li>
<li><b>Reopening Hachibu no longer starts that wait again.</b> The time the battery was already hot is read from what History recorded, so a restart or an update while the battery is hot does not delay the pause.</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://github.com/hammadmo/hachibu/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">Every version's changes</a></p>
]]></description>
