            <description><![CDATA[<h2>New</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>See charging at a glance.</b> The right end of the battery in the menu bar icon changes with the power source: the plain terminal on battery, two plug pins when the charger is connected but the battery is not charging, and a bolt while charging.</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://github.com/hammadmo/hachibu/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">Every version's changes</a></p>]]></description>
